        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Hughes, David William \"Hughesy\" Hughes, Fletcher Pilon, Morris\n- Roles: host, comedian, radio presenter, television presenter, singer, songwriter\n- Events: Australia's Got Talent season 8\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Hughes, born David William \"Hughesy\" Hughes on 26 November 1970 in Warrnambool, Victoria, is an Australian stand-up comedian and a radio and television presenter.\n- Morris did not return as host of Australia's Got Talent season 8 because she was committed to another show.\n- Dave Hughes replaced Morris as host of Australia's Got Talent season 8.\n- Fletcher Pilon, born 6 April 2001, is an Australian acoustic singer and songwriter.\n- Fletcher Pilon won the eighth season of Australia's Got Talent in March 2016.",
